Source: librust-r2r
Section: rust
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ${MAINTAINER}
Build-Depends: ${DEBIAN_BUILD_DEPENDS}
Standards-Version: 4.7.4

Package: librust-r2r-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libclang-dev,
 librust-bindgen-dev (>= 0.72),
 librust-futures-dev (>= 0.3),
 librust-indexmap-dev (>= 2.2),
 librust-itertools-dev (>= 0.14),
 librust-lazy-static-dev (>= 1.4),
 librust-libc-dev (>= 0.2),
 librust-log-dev (>= 0.4),
 librust-os-str-bytes-dev (>= 7),
 librust-paste-dev (>= 1),
 librust-phf-dev (>= 0.11),
 librust-phf+macros-dev (>= 0.11),
 librust-prettyplease-dev (>= 0.2),
 librust-proc-macro2-dev (>= 1),
 librust-quote-dev (>= 1),
 librust-rayon-dev (>= 1.7),
 librust-regex-dev (>= 1.8),
 librust-serde-dev (>= 1),
 librust-serde+derive-dev (>= 1),
 librust-serde-json-dev (>= 1),
 librust-sha2-dev (>= 0.10),
 librust-syn-dev (>= 2),
 librust-thiserror-1-dev (>= 1),
 librust-uuid-dev (>= 1.2),
 librust-uuid+features-dev (>= 1.2),
 librust-widestring-dev (>= 1)
Description: ROS 2 Rust client library crate sources
 Installs r2r, r2r_actions, r2r_common, r2r_macros, r2r_msg_gen, r2r_rcl
 and force-send-sync crate sources into the system Cargo registry for
 downstream Rust package builds. All other dependencies come from
 Ubuntu's packaged crates.
